BaseName        Mo          #Equal to your *.cell's file name(MoASTEP); Any string(VASP). It will be the folder name of all result
CalMode         S          #Specific the calculate mode, W for whole, S for specific(STRAINMODE file is required)
GenSM           0          # 1 for using the build-in strain modes, 0 for using user-supplied strain modes
Geom            1
FlagSE          S          #Method. E for strain-Energy, S for strain-Stress
CoefMethod      Fit        #Method for Coefficient. Fit for fitting, Num for numerical differentiation, if Num, set STEPS=5 and the strain must be symmetrical
Continue        1          #Continue mode, 0 for New, 1 for Continue
CrystalType     C1     #The crystal type, using Laue group
Ord             3          #The Order, now only 3 is supported
EnergyCode      abacus     #Code to calculate the energy or stress. Now noly castep and vasp are supported
EnergyRun       1          # 1(default. RunCASTEP.sh/bat -NP NP BaseName[CASTEP], mpirun -np NP vasp_std[VASP]), 0(manual)
MaxStrain       5.00       #The maximum strain used in the calculation
MinStrain       -5.00      #The minimum strain used in the calculation
STEPS           11          #The steps used in the calculation
Acc             4          #The accuracy for numerical differentiation(not work for fitting)
NP              8          #The cores used in the energy/stress calculation
